{"unit_id":"54c90343692b50a7df6a","title":"六、重申消化性潰瘍用藥使用規定","kind":"advisory","blocks":[{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p6-b22","raw_text":"六、重申消化性潰瘍用藥使用規定 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":17,"bbox":[28.440000534057617,697.3560791015625,276.3500061035156,713.3160400390625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p6-b23","raw_text":"1.4 元以下之 peptic ulcer 用藥包括 H2 blocker、PPI 不需胃鏡報告， \n","start_char":0,"end_char":51,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,727.3560791015625,567.4199829101562,743.3160400390625]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b1","raw_text":"即可使用 (健保藥品給付規定)。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":18,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,47.216041564941406,311.4100036621094,63.17604064941406]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b2","raw_text":"2.因腦中風，冠狀動脈疾病或周邊血管疾病，或易出血體質(備註) 而需\n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,77.23600006103516,559.4400634765625,93.19599914550781]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b3","raw_text":"使用雙重抗血小板藥物及抗凝血藥物，如 aspirin、 warfarin、\n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,107.23600006103516,527.52001953125,123.19599914550781]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b4","raw_text":"tirofiban、 cilostazol、 P2Y12 inhibitor (如 clopidogrel、 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":56,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,137.23599243164062,543.5399780273438,153.1959991455078]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b5","raw_text":"ticagrelor、ticlopidine、 prasugrel)或新一代口服抗凝血藥物(如 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":49,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,167.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,183.1959991455078]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b6","raw_text":"rivaroxaban、 apixaban、edoxaban、 dabigatran)病人得以使用每\n","start_char":0,"end_char":51,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,197.23599243164062,551.3717041015625,213.1959991455078]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b7","raw_text":"日藥費 6.5 元以下之氫離子幫浦阻 斷劑(PPI)，最長以 16 週為限; \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,227.23599243164062,559.3799438476562,243.1959991455078]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b8","raw_text":"若為曾接受過內視鏡檢查，經彩色內視鏡圖譜證實有活動性消化性潰\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,257.2660217285156,551.1177368164062,273.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b9","raw_text":"瘍或上消化道出血，最長以一年為限，如使用期間或停藥後，活動性\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,287.2660217285156,551.1177368164062,303.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b10","raw_text":"消化性潰瘍再發或上消化道出血，得再治療一年。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":24,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,317.2660217285156,431.32000732421875,333.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b11","raw_text":"備註:易出血性體質建議如下: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,347.2660217285156,288.010009765625,363.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b12","raw_text":"I. 第五期慢性腎臟病（eGFR<15mL/min/1.73M2)或透析治治療中 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,377.2660217285156,527.4599609375,393.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b13","raw_text":"II. 血小板<80,000 /mm3。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":22,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,407.2660217285156,272.0299987792969,423.22601318359375]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b14","raw_text":"III. 肝臟疾病且 INR>1.7。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":21,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,437.2860107421875,279.4700012207031,453.2460021972656]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b15","raw_text":"IV. 其他凝血功能不全疾病。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":17,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,467.2860107421875,288.010009765625,483.2460021972656]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b16","raw_text":"3.需使用 NSAIDs 而曾經上消化道內視鏡或X 光攝影證實有過潰瘍，\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[71.54399871826172,497.2860107421875,551.4751586914062,513.2460327148438]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b17","raw_text":"得於使用 NSAIDs 期間內，使用消化性潰瘍用藥。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":28,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,527.2860107421875,445.6000061035156,543.2459716796875]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b18","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[43.08000183105469,557.2860107421875,79.52400207519531,587.2860107421875]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p7-b18","raw_text":" \n","start_char":2,"end_char":4,"bbox":[43.08000183105469,557.2860107421875,79.52400207519531,587.2860107421875]}],"source_quality":[]}